        "text": "How to find more cmdlets\nCmdlets are usually bundled together into packages called modules. We\u2019ll cover module structure\nin detail in Chapter 11 , Creating Our First Module , but for now, it is enough to know that a module\nis a collection of cmdlets with a common theme, such as interacting with a particular application or\nperforming a set of similar functions. Once a module is installed and imported, the cmdlets become\navailable in the shell or to a script.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Finding modules and cmdlets on your machine\n\u2022 Finding new modules and cmdlets\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
